WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.460
Mother nature isn’t something you should
mess with, and the same goes with her daughter.

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:08.719
This is SCP-682 VS SCP-166.

00:00:08.719 --> 00:00:14.380
This teenage nature sprite was put head to
head with SCP-682, the Hard to Destroy Reptile,

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.910
in a test conducted by Dr. Tralmaxoth.

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:22.190
As SCP-682 attacked her, its body melted away
into a patch of grass with flowers sprouting

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.190
out of it.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:27.340
However, within fifteen minutes, it began
regenerating as quickly as it had first melted,

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:31.010
into a version of itself briefly covered in
flowers and mushrooms.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:35.020
It even sprouted a whole tree out of its back,
breaking the test chamber’s ceiling.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:37.790
Dr. Tralmaxoth may need to pay to get that
repaired.

